What happened to Tumblr?

00:11:11.324 --> 00:11:13.949
I think it's a different
animal now, and I think,

00:11:13.949 --> 00:11:17.737
depending on how you want
to communicate to the world,

00:11:17.737 --> 00:11:19.823
for example, I think Tumblr
has been a tremendous

00:11:19.823 --> 00:11:22.494
anonymous platform for people

00:11:22.494 --> 00:11:24.119
