00:11:39.629 --> 00:11:42.671
Medium, people tend to be
themselves on that platform

00:11:42.671 --> 00:11:44.179
and has been a gateway for them

00:11:44.179 --> 00:11:46.525
to be discovered as great
writers or interesting writers.

00:11:46.525 --> 00:11:48.776
So they're different,

00:11:48.776 --> 00:11:50.310
and that's my two cents
on those two platforms,

00:11:50.310 --> 00:11:52.632
